  "introduction": "Build on Primary 1 knowledge and practise comparing and equivalent fractions.",
  "definition": "Equivalent fractions name the same part of a whole. For fractions with the same denominator, the larger numerator gives the larger fraction. For positive unit fractions of the same whole, a larger denominator gives a smaller part.",
